Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Translate the assessment purpose into observable competencies and a balanced task blueprint. Distinguish intended skills from incidental reading or tool demands, and identify constraints on duration, accessibility, and allowable assistance.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
